### Get All Expenses
GET http://localhost:3000/api/expenses


### Get Single Expense
GET http://localhost:3000/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
### Patch (Update) Single Expense
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Updated Lunch with friends",
  "amount": 50.00
}

### Delete Single Expense
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}

